[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "...But as a little seed. Are you good with that, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510011033.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "If you're the one taking care of me, then I'm sure.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Of course I'll be the one taking care of you! I'm the one who reviews your health reports, after all.",
        "Cv": 510011034.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Even if you became a tiny seed, I'd still know all your little quirks. I'd even know which direction you're planning to grow.",
        "Cv": 510011035.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Now then, close your eyes...",
        "Cv": 510011036.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Temperature: 23.5\u00b0C. Humidity: 85%. Light-dark cycle: 16 hours of light, 8 hours of dark...",
        "Cv": 510011037.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 46,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Liv, you look taller.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "You're awake, Commandant? You're a little seed now.",
        "Cv": 510011038.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 47,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "...!",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 48,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "!!!",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I can't hear your voice clearly, Liv.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Mhm... You've just been planted in space soil. It's normal to feel a bit stifled.",
        "Cv": 510011039.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "But don't worry. I'm right here with you.",
        "Cv": 510011040.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Is it normal for seeds to talk to their researchers?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Of course. I can hear the voices of other seeds too\u2014we just talk through data instead.",
        "Cv": 510011041.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "How are you feeling now, Commandant? Cold? Thirsty?",
        "Cv": 510011042.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I feel a little warm.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I'm a little thirsty.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Let's bring the temperature down a bit... How about now?",
        "Cv": 510011043.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "And raise the humidity a little more... Better?",
        "Cv": 510011044.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 19,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Much better... but it's still dark.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 20,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 22,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Can you hear me now, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510011045.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 23,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Yeah... I just felt a little shock.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 24,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Phew... you scared me. A lot of seeds don't make it because they can't find the right direction to grow. I was trying to guide you using electric signals...",
        "Cv": 510011046.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 25,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Can you see the glowing area around you now?",
        "Cv": 510011047.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 26,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Yeah, I see a spot of light.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 27,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "That's your guiding light. Want to try growing toward it?",
        "Cv": 510011048.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 28,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "(Grow toward the light source)",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 29,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Don't be scared... Take it slow. I'm right here with you.",
        "Cv": 510011049.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 31,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "This world isn't perfect... and you'll face challenges you can't even imagine. But don't be afraid. I'll walk this road with you...",
        "Cv": 510011051.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 32,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Just stay right here. Keep growing, little by little.",
        "Cv": 510011052.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 49,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Yes, Liv?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 33,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "So, Commandant, how did it feel being a little seed?",
        "Cv": 510011053.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 34,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Felt a little rushed?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 35,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I wasn't ready for it to end.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 36,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Mhm... it's still a beta feature, after all.",
        "Cv": 510011054.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 37,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "If you'd like to experience sprouting all over again, I can bring you back here anytime. Who knows, maybe next time, these dandelions will have started to bloom.",
        "Cv": 510011055.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 38,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "Alright. I'll be your seed again next time, Liv.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 39,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I think once was enough...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 40,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Whether you're a seed or the Commandant...",
        "Cv": 510011056.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 41,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "To me, you're still you\u2014my precious little seedling.",
        "Cv": 510011057.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 42,
        "ActorName": "[PlayerName]",
        "ActorTalk": "I'm getting sleepy all of a sudden...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 43,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "It's probably a side effect of the simulation. After all, you were just \"born.\"",
        "Cv": 510011058.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 44,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Don't worry, I'm right here with you, Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510011059.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 45,
        "ActorName": "Liv",
        "ActorTalk": "Go on and rest... and when you reach the other side of the dream, don't forget to grow strong and bloom beautifully.",
        "Cv": 510011060.0,
        "Desc": null
    }
]